reagent-name-cryonex = cryonex
reagent-desc-cryonex = A viscous, plasma stabilized precursor base. Inert on its own - it only becomes useful as a feedstock for further cryogenic synthesis.

reagent-name-cryzine = cryzine
reagent-desc-cryzine = A cold stable stasis compound. Does nothing outside a cryo pod - inside one it heals as the patient cools, but turns harmful if they're left too warm.

reagent-name-traumazine = traumazine
reagent-desc-traumazine = An extremely potent trauma treatment - but it's completely inert outside a cryo pod. Inside one it heals as the patient cools, though it'll harm them instead if they're left too warm.

reagent-name-toxazine = toxazine
reagent-desc-toxazine = An extremely potent antitoxin & cellular repair agent - but it's completely inert outside a cryo pod. Inside one it heals as the patient cools, though it'll poison & mutate them instead if left too warm.

reagent-name-somaline = somaline
reagent-desc-somaline = A potent regenerative catalyst. Rapidly regrows missing limbs. Its genetic repair effect does nothing outside a cryo pod, and turns harmful instead of helpful if the patient's left too warm inside one.
